{"id":3371,"name":"Fumetsu no Anata e","slug":"fumetsu_no_anata_e","synopsis":"In the beginning, an \"orb\" is cast unto Earth. \"It\" can do two things: change into the form of the thing that stimulates \"it\"; and come back to life after death. \"It\" morphs from orb to rock, then to wolf, and finally to boy, but roams about like a newborn who knows nothing. As a boy, \"it\" becomes Fushi.\n\n\nThrough encounters with human kindness, Fushi not only gains survival skills, but grows as a \"person\". But his journey is darkened by the inexplicable and destructive enemy Nokker, as well as cruel partings with the people he loves.\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2021,"createdAt":"2021-04-20 08:11:25","updatedAt":"2021-04-20 10:39:08","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":41025},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":114535},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":15351},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":43211},{"site":"ANN","externalId":23600},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":14420},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":81333467}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":7273,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/p9XnkaR3BtAIiDIrun2YNiGGb9GM54RtZL75bflJ.jpg"},{"id":7274,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/nBVtOF0bGviGaizuWus0YRij2sr65fyT78QfPXkP.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":58,"name":"Brain's Base","slug":"brains_base"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":244,"name":"Fumetsu no Anata e","slug":"fumetsu_no_anata_e"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":10244,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":10245,"title":"PINK BLOOD","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":11994,"version":1,"episodes":"1-20","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":13860,"basename":"FumetsuNoAnataE-OP1.webm","filename":"FumetsuNoAnataE-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/FumetsuNoAnataE-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":37804612,"res